<rml><head><title>Prime Studio — Replay</title><link type="text/rcss" href="../../themes/prime.rcss"/><link type="text/rcss" href="../../components/controls.rcss"/><link type="text/rcss" href="theatre.rcss"/><link type="text/rcss" href="editor.rcss"/><link type="text/rcss" href="camera-tools.rcss"/><link type="text/rcss" href="timeline.rcss"/><link type="text/rcss" href="spatial.rcss"/><link type="text/rcss" href="studio-tools.rcss"/><link type="text/rcss" href="studio-workspace.rcss"/></head><body><div id="studio_workspace"><div id="studio_transport"><div class="studio_title">PRIME STUDIO <span id="replay_state"/> <span id="replay_time"/> <span id="replay_camera"/></div><div class="studio_transport_row"><button id="replay_pause" class="play_action" data-action="replay:toggle-pause">PLAY / PAUSE</button><button id="replay_step" class="play_action" data-action="replay:step">STEP</button><button id="replay_jump_back" class="play_action" data-action="replay:jump-back">−10S</button><button id="replay_jump_forward" class="play_action" data-action="replay:jump-forward">+10S</button><button id="replay_restart" class="play_action" data-action="replay:restart">RESTART</button><button id="replay_mark_in" class="play_action" data-action="replay:mark-in">IN</button><button id="replay_mark_out" class="play_action" data-action="replay:mark-out">OUT</button><button id="replay_previous_player" class="play_action" data-action="replay:previous-player">PREV POV</button><button id="replay_next_player" class="play_action" data-action="replay:next-player">NEXT POV</button><button id="replay_fullscreen" class="play_action" data-action="replay:fullscreen">FULLSCREEN</button><button id="replay_four_views" class="play_action" data-action="replay:four-views">FOUR VIEWS</button><button id="studio_open" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-open">OPEN</button><button id="studio_save_as" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-save-as">SAVE AS…</button><button id="studio_settings" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-settings">SETTINGS</button><button id="replay_back" class="play_action" data-action="replay:back">LIBRARY</button></div><div class="studio_transport_row"><span>FRAME</span><input id="studio_frame" type="text" maxlength="10"/><button id="studio_seek" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-seek">GO</button><button id="studio_rate_0.25" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-rate-0p25">0.25×</button><button id="studio_rate_0.5" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-rate-0p5">0.5×</button><button id="studio_rate_1" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-rate-1">1×</button><button id="studio_rate_2" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-rate-2">2×</button><button id="studio_rate_4" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-rate-4">4×</button><span id="replay_rate"/><span id="replay_range_summary"/><button id="studio_refresh" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-refresh">REFRESH REVIEW</button><input id="replay_position" type="range" min="0" max="1000" step="1" value="0" data-action="replay:seek"/></div><p id="studio_notice"/><p id="replay_error"/></div><div id="studio_main"><div id="replay_viewport" tabindex="0"><div id="replay_view_labels"><span class="view_label view_tl">CURRENT CAMERA</span><span class="view_label view_tr">CHASE</span><span class="view_label view_bl">TARGET POV</span><span class="view_label view_br">OVERVIEW</span></div><div id="replay_inactive">OPEN A REPLAY TO BEGIN</div></div>
<div id="studio_inspector"><div id="studio_tabs"><button id="studio_tab_camera" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-tab-camera">CAMERA</button><button id="studio_tab_markers" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-tab-markers">MARKERS / REEL</button><button id="studio_tab_combat" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-tab-combat">COMBAT</button><button id="studio_tab_analysis" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-tab-analysis">ANALYSIS</button><button id="studio_tab_audio" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-tab-audio">AUDIO / TOOLS</button><button id="studio_tab_export" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-tab-export">EXPORT</button></div><div id="studio_inspector_scroll"><div id="studio_inspector_camera" class="studio_inspector_section"><h3>CAMERA POSE</h3><button id="studio_camera_graph" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-graph">CAMERA GRAPH ↓</button><div class="studio_numeric_grid"><label>X<input id="studio_camera_x" type="text" data-focus-scroll="center" maxlength="20" value="0"/></label><label>Y<input id="studio_camera_y" type="text" data-focus-scroll="center" maxlength="20" value="5"/></label><label>Z<input id="studio_camera_z" type="text" data-focus-scroll="center" maxlength="20" value="10"/></label><label>YAW °<input id="studio_camera_yaw" type="text" data-focus-scroll="center" maxlength="20" value="0"/></label><label>PITCH °<input id="studio_camera_pitch" type="text" data-focus-scroll="center" maxlength="20" value="0"/></label><label>ROLL °<input id="studio_camera_roll" type="text" data-focus-scroll="center" maxlength="20" value="0"/></label><label>FOV °<input id="studio_camera_fov" type="text" data-focus-scroll="center" maxlength="20" value="78"/></label></div><button id="studio_camera_apply" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-apply">APPLY CAMERA</button><button id="studio_preview_hud" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-preview-hud">GAME HUD</button><button id="studio_preview_overlay" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-preview-overlay">REPLAY OVERLAY</button><button id="studio_preview_path" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-preview-path">CAMERA PATH</button><button id="studio_save_view" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-save-view">SAVE VIEW</button><p id="studio_camera_status"/><div class="studio_transport_row"><button id="studio_camera_mode_FirstPerson" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-mode-FirstPerson">PLAYER</button><button id="studio_camera_mode_Free" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-mode-Free">FREE</button><button id="studio_camera_mode_Chase" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-mode-Chase">CHASE</button><button id="studio_camera_mode_Orbit" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-mode-Orbit">ORBIT</button><button id="studio_camera_overview" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-overview">OVERVIEW</button></div><h3>CAMERA SUBJECT</h3><div class="studio_choices"><button id="studio_camera_slot_0" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-slot-0">P1</button><button id="studio_camera_slot_1" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-slot-1">P2</button><button id="studio_camera_slot_2" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-slot-2">P3</button><button id="studio_camera_slot_3" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-slot-3">P4</button><button id="studio_camera_slot_4" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-slot-4">P5</button><button id="studio_camera_slot_5" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-slot-5">P6</button><button id="studio_camera_slot_6" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-slot-6">P7</button><button id="studio_camera_slot_7" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-slot-7">P8</button></div><h3>CAMERA MOTION</h3><div class="studio_choices"><button id="studio_camera_interpolation_0" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-interpolation-0">LINEAR</button><button id="studio_camera_interpolation_1" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-interpolation-1">SMOOTH</button><button id="studio_camera_interpolation_2" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-interpolation-2">SPLINE</button><button id="studio_camera_interpolation_3" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-interpolation-3">HOLD</button><button id="studio_camera_interpolation_4" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-interpolation-4">BEZIER</button></div><p>Ease</p><div class="studio_choices"><button id="studio_camera_ease_0" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-ease-0">NONE</button><button id="studio_camera_ease_1" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-ease-1">IN</button><button id="studio_camera_ease_2" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-ease-2">OUT</button><button id="studio_camera_ease_3" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-ease-3">IN + OUT</button></div><p>Look at</p><div class="studio_choices"><button id="studio_camera_lookat_none" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-lookat-none">NONE</button><button id="studio_camera_lookat_0" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-lookat-0">P1</button><button id="studio_camera_lookat_1" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-lookat-1">P2</button><button id="studio_camera_lookat_2" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-lookat-2">P3</button><button id="studio_camera_lookat_3" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-lookat-3">P4</button><button id="studio_camera_lookat_4" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-lookat-4">P5</button><button id="studio_camera_lookat_5" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-lookat-5">P6</button><button id="studio_camera_lookat_6" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-lookat-6">P7</button><button id="studio_camera_lookat_7" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-lookat-7">P8</button></div><div id="replay_camera_panel" class="prime_dialog">
<h2>CAMERA &amp; KEYFRAMES</h2><p id="replay_camera_replay"/><p>Pause playback to review and save a camera pose. Close this panel to move the free camera in the preview, then reopen it.</p>
<p id="replay_camera_review"/><div class="theatre_actions"><button id="replay_camera_refresh" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-refresh">REFRESH REVIEW</button><button id="replay_camera_free" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-free">FREE CAMERA</button><button id="replay_camera_track" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-track">CAMERA TRACK</button></div>
<div class="theatre_actions"><button id="replay_camera_fov_less" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-fov-less">FOV −5°</button><button id="replay_camera_fov_more" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-fov-more">FOV +5°</button><button id="replay_camera_roll_less" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-roll-less">ROLL −5°</button><button id="replay_camera_roll_more" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-roll-more">ROLL +5°</button></div>
<button id="replay_camera_add" class="play_action primary" data-action="replay:camera-add">SAVE POSE AT REVIEWED FRAME</button>
<p id="replay_camera_count"/><p id="replay_camera_selected"/>
<div class="theatre_actions"><button id="replay_camera_previous" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-previous">PREVIOUS KEY</button><button id="replay_camera_next" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-next">NEXT KEY</button><button id="replay_camera_preview" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-preview">JUMP TO KEY</button></div>
<div class="theatre_actions"><button id="replay_camera_update" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-update">REPLACE SELECTED POSE...</button><button id="replay_camera_remove" class="play_action danger" data-action="replay:camera-remove">REMOVE SELECTED...</button></div>
<button id="replay_camera_tools_open" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-open">CAMERA TRACK TOOLS</button>
<p id="replay_camera_status"/><p id="replay_camera_error" class="bookmark_error"/>
<button id="replay_camera_close" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-close">RETURN TO PLAYBACK</button>
</div><h3>SELECTED KEY SETTINGS</h3><p>Select saved keys, then choose a value and review the confirmation.</p><div class="studio_choices"><button id="studio_camera_key_interpolation_0" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-key-interpolation-0">LINEAR</button><button id="studio_camera_key_interpolation_1" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-key-interpolation-1">SMOOTH</button><button id="studio_camera_key_interpolation_2" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-key-interpolation-2">SPLINE</button><button id="studio_camera_key_interpolation_3" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-key-interpolation-3">HOLD</button><button id="studio_camera_key_interpolation_4" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-key-interpolation-4">BEZIER</button></div><p>Ease</p><div class="studio_choices"><button id="studio_camera_key_ease_0" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-key-ease-0">NONE</button><button id="studio_camera_key_ease_1" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-key-ease-1">IN</button><button id="studio_camera_key_ease_2" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-key-ease-2">OUT</button><button id="studio_camera_key_ease_3" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-key-ease-3">IN + OUT</button></div><p>Look at</p><div class="studio_choices"><button id="studio_camera_key_lookat_none" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-key-lookat-none">NONE</button><button id="studio_camera_key_lookat_0" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-key-lookat-0">P1</button><button id="studio_camera_key_lookat_1" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-key-lookat-1">P2</button><button id="studio_camera_key_lookat_2" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-key-lookat-2">P3</button><button id="studio_camera_key_lookat_3" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-key-lookat-3">P4</button><button id="studio_camera_key_lookat_4" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-key-lookat-4">P5</button><button id="studio_camera_key_lookat_5" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-key-lookat-5">P6</button><button id="studio_camera_key_lookat_6" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-key-lookat-6">P7</button><button id="studio_camera_key_lookat_7" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-camera-key-lookat-7">P8</button></div><div id="replay_camera_tools_panel" class="prime_dialog"><h2>CAMERA TRACK TOOLS</h2><p id="replay_camera_tools_replay"/><p id="replay_camera_tools_review"/><p id="replay_camera_tools_focus"/><p id="replay_camera_tools_selection"/><div class="theatre_actions"><button id="replay_camera_tools_refresh" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-refresh">REFRESH REVIEW</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_previous" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-previous">PREVIOUS KEY</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_next" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-next">NEXT KEY</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_nearest" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-nearest">FOCUS NEAREST</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_preview" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-preview">PREVIEW FOCUSED KEY</button></div><div class="theatre_actions"><button id="replay_camera_tools_toggle" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-toggle-selection">TOGGLE FOCUSED SELECTION</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_range" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-range-selection">SELECT ANCHOR RANGE</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_all" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-select-all">SELECT ALL KEYS</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_clear" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-clear-selection">CLEAR SELECTION</button></div><label for="replay_camera_tools_destination">DESTINATION FRAME</label><input id="replay_camera_tools_destination" type="text" maxlength="10"/><p>Group move and paste place the earliest selected or copied key at the destination and preserve the spacing between keys. Existing destination keys are preserved; collisions are refused.</p><div class="theatre_actions"><button id="replay_camera_tools_move" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-move">MOVE SELECTED GROUP...</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_copy" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-copy">COPY SELECTED</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_paste" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-paste">PASTE COPIED GROUP...</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_duplicate" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-duplicate">DUPLICATE PRECEDING AT PLAYHEAD...</button></div><p>Snap one selected key to the reviewed nearest marker at the playhead.</p><div class="theatre_actions"><button id="replay_camera_tools_snap_event" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-snap-event">SNAP TO NEAREST EVENT...</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_snap_kill" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-snap-kill">SNAP TO NEAREST KILL...</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_snap_bookmark" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-snap-bookmark">SNAP TO NEAREST BOOKMARK...</button></div><div class="theatre_actions"><button id="replay_camera_tools_interpolation" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-interpolation">CYCLE SELECTED INTERPOLATION...</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_ease" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-ease">CYCLE SELECTED EASING...</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_look_at" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-look-at">CYCLE SELECTED LOOK-AT PLAYER...</button><button id="replay_camera_tools_remove" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-remove-selected">REMOVE SELECTED KEYS...</button></div><button id="replay_camera_tools_timeline" class="play_action" data-action="replay:timeline-open">GRAPHICAL TIMELINE</button><h3>TRANSFORM SELECTED KEYS</h3><p>Rotate around the world origin, then translate. Rotation values and lens offsets are degrees. The whole group keeps its spacing; destination collisions are refused.</p><label for="replay_camera_transform_x">TRANSLATE X</label><input id="replay_camera_transform_x" type="text" maxlength="16" value="0"/><label for="replay_camera_transform_y">TRANSLATE Y</label><input id="replay_camera_transform_y" type="text" maxlength="16" value="0"/><label for="replay_camera_transform_z">TRANSLATE Z</label><input id="replay_camera_transform_z" type="text" maxlength="16" value="0"/><label for="replay_camera_transform_yaw">ROTATE YAW</label><input id="replay_camera_transform_yaw" type="text" maxlength="16" value="0"/><label for="replay_camera_transform_pitch">ROTATE PITCH</label><input id="replay_camera_transform_pitch" type="text" maxlength="16" value="0"/><label for="replay_camera_transform_roll">ROTATE ROLL</label><input id="replay_camera_transform_roll" type="text" maxlength="16" value="0"/><label for="replay_camera_transform_frame">FRAME OFFSET</label><input id="replay_camera_transform_frame" type="text" maxlength="16" value="0"/><label for="replay_camera_transform_fov">FOV OFFSET</label><input id="replay_camera_transform_fov" type="text" maxlength="16" value="0"/><label for="replay_camera_transform_lens_roll">CAMERA ROLL OFFSET</label><input id="replay_camera_transform_lens_roll" type="text" maxlength="16" value="0"/><button id="replay_camera_tools_transform" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-transform">REVIEW SELECTED TRANSFORM...</button><h3>BEZIER HANDLES</h3><p>Position handles are offsets from each selected key. Use auto for one-third segment handles. Scalar handles are FOV in/out and roll in/out offsets, in degrees.</p><label for="replay_camera_handles_in">INCOMING X, Y, Z</label><input id="replay_camera_handles_in" type="text" maxlength="128" value="auto"/><label for="replay_camera_handles_out">OUTGOING X, Y, Z</label><input id="replay_camera_handles_out" type="text" maxlength="128" value="auto"/><label for="replay_camera_handles_scalar">FOV IN, FOV OUT, ROLL IN, ROLL OUT</label><input id="replay_camera_handles_scalar" type="text" maxlength="128" value="0, 0, 0, 0"/><button id="replay_camera_tools_handles" class="play_action" data-action="replay:camera-tools-handles">REVIEW SELECTED BEZIER HANDLES...</button><h3>SAMPLED CAMERA CURVES</h3><p>Drag yellow authored keys vertically to change that channel. Blue incoming and gold outgoing handles edit Bezier tangents. Dragging previews an exact change; release opens a review. The graphical timeline edits key times.</p><div id="replay_camera_curve_surface" tabindex="0"><p>64 samples from the saved camera track, including its interpolation, easing and constant-speed setting. Each channel uses its own vertical bounds. Use the graphical timeline to select and retime keys.</p><p id="replay_camera_curve_bounds_0"/><div class="camera_curve" id="replay_camera_curve_lane_0" data-focus-scroll="center" tabindex="0"><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_0" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_1" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_2" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_3" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_4" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_5" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_6" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_7" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_8" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_9" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_10" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span id="replay_camera_curve_0_11" class="curve_point curve_y_0"/><span