on" data-action="replay:workspace-export-fps-30">30 FPS</button><button id="studio_export_fps_48" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-export-fps-48">48 FPS</button><button id="studio_export_fps_60" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-export-fps-60">60 FPS</button><button id="studio_export_fps_90" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-export-fps-90">90 FPS</button><button id="studio_export_fps_120" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-export-fps-120">120 FPS</button><button id="studio_export_fps_144" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-export-fps-144">144 FPS</button></div><h3>RESOLUTION</h3><div class="studio_transport_row"><button id="studio_export_resolution_0" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-export-resolution-0">720P</button><button id="studio_export_resolution_1" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-export-resolution-1">1080P</button><button id="studio_export_resolution_2" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-export-resolution-2">1440P</button><button id="studio_export_resolution_3" class="play_action" data-action="replay:workspace-export-resolution-3">4K</button></div><p id="replay_export_replay"/><p>Choose the reviewed marks, full replay or saved reel. Camera track exports use saved keyframes. Accepted jobs continue after returning to the Library. You can open and edit another replay while rendering.</p><p id="replay_export_range"/><label for="replay_export_executable">ENCODER EXECUTABLE (LEAVE BLANK FOR PNG + WAV)</label><input id="replay_export_executable" type="text" maxlength="32768" value="ffmpeg"/><p id="replay_export_audio_summary"/>
<div class="theatre_actions"><button id="replay_export_source" class="play_action" data-action="replay:export-source">SOURCE</button><button id="replay_export_camera" class="play_action" data-action="replay:export-camera">CAMERA</button><button id="replay_export_refresh" class="play_action" data-action="replay:export-refresh">REFRESH REVIEW</button></div>
